      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, after an inspection of a document under this section, the\nTribunal is satisfied that the document is an exempt document, the\nTribunal must return the document to the person by whom it was\nproduced without permitting a person to have access to the\ndocument or disclosing the contents of the document to a person,\nunless the person is:\n\n(a) a member of the Tribunal as constituted for the purposes of\nthe proceeding; or\n\n(b) a member of the staff of the Tribunal in the course of the\nperformance of his or her duties as a member of that staff; or\n\n(c) in the circumstances permitted under paragraph 60A(6)(a)—\nthe Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If, after an inspection of a document under this section, the\nTribunal is satisfied that the document is an exempt document, the\nTribunal must return the document to the person by whom it was\nproduced without permitting a person to have access to the\ndocument or disclosing the contents of the document to a person,\nunless the person is:\n\n(a) a member of the Tribunal as constituted for the purposes of\nthe proceeding; or\n\n(b) a member of the staff of the Tribunal in the course of the\nperformance of his or her duties as a member of that staff; or\n\n(c) in the circumstances permitted under paragraph 60A(6)(a)—\nthe Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ecb89191e1ba1b9aadd5280e55698e58da65971b1158a856e39a4701cd9e38eb",
      "skos:note": "Tribunal must not disclose document contents to unauthorized persons."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "58E(3) Production to the Tribunal of certain exempt documents",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If, after an inspection of a document under this section, the\nTribunal is satisfied that the document is an exempt document, the\nTribunal must return the document to the person by whom it was\nproduced without permitting a person to have access to the\ndocument or disclosing the contents of the document to a person,\nunless the person is:\n\n(a) a member of the Tribunal as constituted for the purposes of\nthe proceeding; or\n\n(b) a member of the staff of the Tribunal in the course of the\nperformance of his or her duties as a member of that staff; or\n\n(c) in the circumstances permitted under paragraph 60A(6)(a)—\nthe Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Prohibit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of disclosure",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Tribunal must not disclose document contents.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Unauthorized persons are prohibited from accessing the document."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Temporal Interval",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal interval for authorized access",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Tribunal must return the document to a person within a certain time frame.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Authorized personnel have a temporal interval for accessing the document."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implication",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Implication of authorized access on disclosure",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "If a person is authorized to access the document, then they must not be disclosed.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Authorized access implies non-disclosure."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Containment",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Containment of unauthorized disclosure",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Tribunal must contain unauthorized disclosure by returning the document to a person who is authorized.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Unauthorized disclosure is contained by returning the document to an authorized person."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-58e-ss-3-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:CogAI"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Inference",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Inference of authorized access from Tribunal decision",
      "cml:executionSurface": "sparql_library::parsers::chk_parser",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The Tribunal's decision implies that a person is authorized to access the document.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Authorized access is inferred from the Tribunal's decision."
    },
    {
