    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-2009-3-ss-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2009(9) No. 99, 2009",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-1-sec-2009-3-ss-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.12",
      "values:originalText": "(9) The Tribunal must allow the Inspector-General a period within\nwhich to consider the documents mentioned in paragraphs (6)(a) to\n(d) that is reasonable having regard to:\n\n(a) the nature of the evidence that the Inspector-General has been\nrequested to give; and\n\n(b) the time required by the Inspector-General to perform the\nInspector-General’s other functions.",
      "skos:definition": "(9) The Tribunal must allow the Inspector-General a period within\nwhich to consider the documents mentioned in paragraphs (6)(a) to\n(d) that is reasonable having regard to:\n\n(a) the nature of the evidence that the Inspector-General has been\nrequested to give; and\n\n(b) the time required by the Inspector-General to perform the\nInspector-General’s other functions.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-2009-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-2009-3-ss-9-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-2009-3-ss-9-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b0c802e1342290bbcebd1187b41113aad2c64791b7c3f78bccdf33d23166504d",
      "skos:note": "Inspector-General must be given a reasonable time to consider documents."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-1-sec-2009-3-ss-9",
