      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-1-sec-67-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "67(5) Automatic stay of certain decisions on appeal",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "(5) Nothing in this section affects the power of the Federal Court of\nAustralia or the Federal Magistrates Court to make orders under\nsection 44A of the Administrative Appeals Tribunal Act 1975 in\nrelation to matters other than staying the decision of the Tribunal."
    },
