    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-34",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "34 Application provision—items 4 to 32",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-1-sec-34"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.16",
      "values:originalText": "Freedom of Information Act 1982  Schedule 1\n\nFreedom of Information (Removal of Conclusive Certificates and Other Measures) Act 2009\nNo. 99, 2009            13\n(1)\nThe amendments made by items 4 to 32 of this Schedule apply for the\npurposes of determining whether access to a document of an agency or\nan official document of a Minister will be given in accordance with a\nrequest made under subsection 15(2) of the Freedom of Information Act\n1982 and received by the agency or Minister on or after the\ncommencement of this Schedule.\n(2)\nA certificate issued in relation to a document under subsection 33(2),\n33(4), 33A(2), 33A(4), 34(2), 34(4), 35(2), 35(4) or 36(3) of the\nFreedom of Information Act 1982 (as in force immediately before the\ncommencement of this Schedule) is, by force of this subitem, revoked\nin relation to the document on and from the time at which the first\nrequest for access to the document under the Freedom of Information\nAct 1982 is made on or after the commencement of this Schedule.\n(3)\nTo avoid doubt:\n\n(a) subitem (2) does not affect anything done in relation to, or in\nreliance on, a certificate mentioned in subitem (2) before the\ncommencement of this Schedule; and\n\n(b) nothing prevents a person from making a request, on and\nafter the commencement of this Schedule, for access to a\ndocument of an agency or an official document of a Minister\nunder the Freedom of Information Act 1982 if:\n\n(i) before the commencement of this Schedule, the person\nmade a request for access to the same document; and\n\n(ii) the request was refused in reliance on a certificate\nmentioned in subitem (2).",
      "skos:definition": "Freedom of Information Act 1982  Schedule 1\n\nFreedom of Information (Removal of Conclusive Certificates and Other Measures) Act 2009\nNo. 99, 2009            13\n(1)\nThe amendments made by items 4 to 32 of this Schedule apply for the\npurposes of determining whether access to a document of an agency or\nan official document of a Minister will be given in accordance with a\nrequest made under subsection 15(2) of the Freedom of Information Act\n1982 and received by the agency or Minister on or after the\ncommencement of this Schedule.\n(2)\nA certificate issued in relation to a document under subsection 33(2),\n33(4), 33A(2), 33A(4), 34(2), 34(4), 35(2), 35(4) or 36(3) of the\nFreedom of Information Act 1982 (as in force immediately before the\ncommencement of this Schedule) is, by force of this subitem, revoked\nin relation to the document on and from the time at which the first\nrequest for access to the document under the Freedom of Information\nAct 1982 is made on or after the commencement of this Schedule.\n(3)\nTo avoid doubt:\n\n(a) subitem (2) does not affect anything done in relation to, or in\nreliance on, a certificate mentioned in subitem (2) before the\ncommencement of this Schedule; and\n\n(b) nothing prevents a person from making a request, on and\nafter the commencement of this Schedule, for access to a\ndocument of an agency or an official document of a Minister\nunder the Freedom of Information Act 1982 if:\n\n(i) before the commencement of this Schedule, the person\nmade a request for access to the same document; and\n\n(ii) the request was refused in reliance on a certificate\nmentioned in subitem (2).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-34-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-1-sec-34-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6c2586fc0145a59d214a484b6133d7171a8ace80a927cd9662f6388696dced4f",
      "skos:note": "Amendments apply for determining access to documents made under the Freedom of Information Act 1982."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-1-sec-34",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "34 Application provision—items 4 to 32",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 16,
      "values:originalText": "Freedom of Information Act 1982  Schedule 1\n\nFreedom of Information (Removal of Conclusive Certificates and Other Measures) Act 2009\nNo. 99, 2009            13\n(1)\nThe amendments made by items 4 to 32 of this Schedule apply for the\npurposes of determining whether access to a document of an agency or\nan official document of a Minister will be given in accordance with a\nrequest made under subsection 15(2) of the Freedom of Information Act\n1982 and received by the agency or Minister on or after the\ncommencement of this Schedule.\n(2)\nA certificate issued in relation to a document under subsection 33(2),\n33(4), 33A(2), 33A(4), 34(2), 34(4), 35(2), 35(4) or 36(3) of the\nFreedom of Information Act 1982 (as in force immediately before the\ncommencement of this Schedule) is, by force of this subitem, revoked\nin relation to the document on and from the time at which the first\nrequest for access to the document under the Freedom of Information\nAct 1982 is made on or after the commencement of this Schedule.\n(3)\nTo avoid doubt:\n\n(a) subitem (2) does not affect anything done in relation to, or in\nreliance on, a certificate mentioned in subitem (2) before the\ncommencement of this Schedule; and\n\n(b) nothing prevents a person from making a request, on and\nafter the commencement of this Schedule, for access to a\ndocument of an agency or an official document of a Minister\nunder the Freedom of Information Act 1982 if:\n\n(i) before the commencement of this Schedule, the person\nmade a request for access to the same document; and\n\n(ii) the request was refused in reliance on a certificate\nmentioned in subitem (2)."
    },
