    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1 Subsections 29(6) and (7)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-2-sec-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.18",
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(6) A record that is in the open access period is not, by virtue of a\ndetermination under subsection (1), a record to which\nparagraph (1)(b) applies unless:\n\n(a) the record is an exempt record for the reason that it contains\ninformation or matter of a kind referred to in paragraph\n33(1)(a) or (b); and\n\n(b) a security classification applies to the record such that access\nby the Archives would not be appropriate.\n\n(7) A record that is in the open access period is not, by virtue of a\ndetermination under subsection (2), a record to which\nparagraph (2)(b) applies unless:\n\n(a) the record is an exempt record for the reason that it contains\ninformation or matter of a kind referred to in paragraph\n33(1)(a) or (b); and\n\n(b) a security classification applies to the record such that access\nby the Archives would not be appropriate.",
      "skos:definition": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(6) A record that is in the open access period is not, by virtue of a\ndetermination under subsection (1), a record to which\nparagraph (1)(b) applies unless:\n\n(a) the record is an exempt record for the reason that it contains\ninformation or matter of a kind referred to in paragraph\n33(1)(a) or (b); and\n\n(b) a security classification applies to the record such that access\nby the Archives would not be appropriate.\n\n(7) A record that is in the open access period is not, by virtue of a\ndetermination under subsection (2), a record to which\nparagraph (2)(b) applies unless:\n\n(a) the record is an exempt record for the reason that it contains\ninformation or matter of a kind referred to in paragraph\n33(1)(a) or (b); and\n\n(b) a security classification applies to the record such that access\nby the Archives would not be appropriate.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-1-ss-6"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-1-ss-7"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "45006b563b2fa2182b7ea81cca2aac16faa404d7946d1c0f51f91fbff6cf069d"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-2-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Subsections 29(6) and (7)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "Repeal the subsections, substitute:\n\n(6) A record that is in the open access period is not, by virtue of a\ndetermination under subsection (1), a record to which\nparagraph (1)(b) applies unless:\n\n(a) the record is an exempt record for the reason that it contains\ninformation or matter of a kind referred to in paragraph\n33(1)(a) or (b); and\n\n(b) a security classification applies to the record such that access\nby the Archives would not be appropriate.\n\n(7) A record that is in the open access period is not, by virtue of a\ndetermination under subsection (2), a record to which\nparagraph (2)(b) applies unless:\n\n(a) the record is an exempt record for the reason that it contains\ninformation or matter of a kind referred to in paragraph\n33(1)(a) or (b); and\n\n(b) a security classification applies to the record such that access\nby the Archives would not be appropriate."
    },
    {
