        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-1-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9da95e321855573edfb7351a8e73bd3d2115d891aa5d626832d3dd0047c2519d",
      "skos:note": "Exempt records containing certain information are not subject to access restrictions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-2-sec-1-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(6) Subsections 29(6) and (7)",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 18,
      "values:originalText": "(6) A record that is in the open access period is not, by virtue of a\ndetermination under subsection (1), a record to which\nparagraph (1)(b) applies unless:\n\n(a) the record is an exempt record for the reason that it contains\ninformation or matter of a kind referred to in paragraph\n33(1)(a) or (b); and\n\n(b) a security classification applies to the record such that access\nby the Archives would not be appropriate."
    },
