      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Before hearing the evidence of the Inspector-General, the Tribunal\nmust hear any evidence to be given or submissions to be made by\nor on behalf of:\n\n(a) the Archives; or\n\n(b) the Commonwealth institution of which the record is\nproperty.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Before hearing the evidence of the Inspector-General, the Tribunal\nmust hear any evidence to be given or submissions to be made by\nor on behalf of:\n\n(a) the Archives; or\n\n(b) the Commonwealth institution of which the record is\nproperty.",
