    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2009 No. 99, 2009",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-2-sec-2009-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.22",
      "values:originalText": "(9) The Tribunal must allow the Inspector-General a period within\nwhich to consider the records mentioned in paragraphs (6)(a) to (d)\nthat is reasonable having regard to:\n\n(a) the nature of the evidence that the Inspector-General has been\nrequested to give; and\n\n(b) the time required by the Inspector-General to perform the\nInspector-General’s other functions.\n\n(10) The fact that a person is obliged to produce a document under\nsubsection (6) does not otherwise affect a claim of legal\nprofessional privilege that anyone may make in relation to that\ndocument.",
      "skos:definition": "(9) The Tribunal must allow the Inspector-General a period within\nwhich to consider the records mentioned in paragraphs (6)(a) to (d)\nthat is reasonable having regard to:\n\n(a) the nature of the evidence that the Inspector-General has been\nrequested to give; and\n\n(b) the time required by the Inspector-General to perform the\nInspector-General’s other functions.\n\n(10) The fact that a person is obliged to produce a document under\nsubsection (6) does not otherwise affect a claim of legal\nprofessional privilege that anyone may make in relation to that\ndocument.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-2-ss-9"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-2009-2-ss-10"
