    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-19",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "19 Application provision—item 1",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-2-sec-19"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by item 1 of this Schedule do not apply to a\nCommonwealth record if:\n\n(a) the record is in the open access period; and\n\n(b) a determination has been made in respect of the record under\nsubsection 29(1) or (2) of the Archives Act 1983; and\n\n(c) a certificate under section 34 of the Archives Act 1983 (as in\nforce immediately before the commencement of this\nSchedule) is in force in respect of the record.\nNote:\nA certificate ceases to be in force if it is revoked by force of subitem\n20(2).",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments made by item 1 of this Schedule do not apply to a\nCommonwealth record if:\n\n(a) the record is in the open access period; and\n\n(b) a determination has been made in respect of the record under\nsubsection 29(1) or (2) of the Archives Act 1983; and\n\n(c) a certificate under section 34 of the Archives Act 1983 (as in\nforce immediately before the commencement of this\nSchedule) is in force in respect of the record.\nNote:\nA certificate ceases to be in force if it is revoked by force of subitem\n20(2).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-19-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4b98690515cf840b80f40bc40840e68e598c04dbac81f3fdc7f3130dba23dbd6",
      "skos:note": "Exemptions from amendments for Commonwealth records"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-2-sec-19",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "19 Application provision—item 1",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "The amendments made by item 1 of this Schedule do not apply to a\nCommonwealth record if:\n\n(a) the record is in the open access period; and\n\n(b) a determination has been made in respect of the record under\nsubsection 29(1) or (2) of the Archives Act 1983; and\n\n(c) a certificate under section 34 of the Archives Act 1983 (as in\nforce immediately before the commencement of this\nSchedule) is in force in respect of the record.\nNote:\nA certificate ceases to be in force if it is revoked by force of subitem\n20(2)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-19-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-19"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-20-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "20 Application provision—items 2 to 16",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-2-sec-20-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.25",
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by items 2 to 16 of this Schedule apply for the\npurposes of determining whether access, or an extension of partial\naccess, to a record referred to in section 31 of the Archives Act 1983\nwill be given in accordance with an application made under section 40\nof that Act and received by the Archives on or after the commencement\nof this Schedule.\n(2)\nA certificate issued in relation to a Commonwealth record under\nsection 34 of the Archives Act 1983 (as in force immediately before the\ncommencement of this Schedule) is, by force of this subitem, revoked\nin relation to the record on and from the time at which the first\napplication for access to the record under the Archives Act 1983 is\nmade, on or after the commencement of this Schedule.\n(3)\nTo avoid doubt:\n\n(a) subitem (2) does not affect anything done in relation to, or in\nreliance on, a certificate mentioned in subitem (2) before the\ncommencement of this Schedule; and\n\n(b) nothing prevents a person from applying, on and after the\ncommencement of this Schedule, for access to a\nCommonwealth record under the Archives Act 1983 if:\n\n(i) before the commencement of this Schedule, the person\napplied for access to the same record; and\n\n(ii) the application was refused in reliance on a certificate\nmentioned in subitem (2).\n\nSchedule 2  Archives Act 1983",
      "skos:definition": "(1)\nThe amendments made by items 2 to 16 of this Schedule apply for the\npurposes of determining whether access, or an extension of partial\naccess, to a record referred to in section 31 of the Archives Act 1983\nwill be given in accordance with an application made under section 40\nof that Act and received by the Archives on or after the commencement\nof this Schedule.\n(2)\nA certificate issued in relation to a Commonwealth record under\nsection 34 of the Archives Act 1983 (as in force immediately before the\ncommencement of this Schedule) is, by force of this subitem, revoked\nin relation to the record on and from the time at which the first\napplication for access to the record under the Archives Act 1983 is\nmade, on or after the commencement of this Schedule.\n(3)\nTo avoid doubt:\n\n(a) subitem (2) does not affect anything done in relation to, or in\nreliance on, a certificate mentioned in subitem (2) before the\ncommencement of this Schedule; and\n\n(b) nothing prevents a person from applying, on and after the\ncommencement of this Schedule, for access to a\nCommonwealth record under the Archives Act 1983 if:\n\n(i) before the commencement of this Schedule, the person\napplied for access to the same record; and\n\n(ii) the application was refused in reliance on a certificate\nmentioned in subitem (2).\n\nSchedule 2  Archives Act 1983",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-20-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-2-sec-20-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4627f7b861b5be09176127dc10102a7dcee8183227baf94c3fecfe8a9f91830e",
      "skos:note": "Amendments apply for determining access to records under Archives Act 1983"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-2-sec-20-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "20 Application provision—items 2 to 16",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 25,
      "values:originalText": "(1)\nThe amendments made by items 2 to 16 of this Schedule apply for the\npurposes of determining whether access, or an extension of partial\naccess, to a record referred to in section 31 of the Archives Act 1983\nwill be given in accordance with an application made under section 40\nof that Act and received by the Archives on or after the commencement\nof this Schedule.\n(2)\nA certificate issued in relation to a Commonwealth record under\nsection 34 of the Archives Act 1983 (as in force immediately before the\ncommencement of this Schedule) is, by force of this subitem, revoked\nin relation to the record on and from the time at which the first\napplication for access to the record under the Archives Act 1983 is\nmade, on or after the commencement of this Schedule.\n(3)\nTo avoid doubt:\n\n(a) subitem (2) does not affect anything done in relation to, or in\nreliance on, a certificate mentioned in subitem (2) before the\ncommencement of this Schedule; and\n\n(b) nothing prevents a person from applying, on and after the\ncommencement of this Schedule, for access to a\nCommonwealth record under the Archives Act 1983 if:\n\n(i) before the commencement of this Schedule, the person\napplied for access to the same record; and\n\n(ii) the application was refused in reliance on a certificate\nmentioned in subitem (2).\n\nSchedule 2  Archives Act 1983"
    },
