    {
      "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-3-sec-2009-ss-11",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2009(11) No. 99, 2009",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009#sch-3-sec-2009-ss-11"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(11) If the Division:\n\n(a) is reconstituted in accordance with a direction under\nsubsection (6); or\n\n(b) is reconstituted because proceedings are remitted under\nparagraph (7)(b) to the Division as previously constituted; or\n\n(c) is reconstituted under subsection (10) because a member\nceases to be available;\nthe members of the Division may have regard to any record of the\nproceeding in the Division as previously constituted, including a\nrecord of any evidence taken in the proceeding.\n\nSchedule 4  Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986",
      "skos:definition": "(11) If the Division:\n\n(a) is reconstituted in accordance with a direction under\nsubsection (6); or\n\n(b) is reconstituted because proceedings are remitted under\nparagraph (7)(b) to the Division as previously constituted; or\n\n(c) is reconstituted under subsection (10) because a member\nceases to be available;\nthe members of the Division may have regard to any record of the\nproceeding in the Division as previously constituted, including a\nrecord of any evidence taken in the proceeding.\n\nSchedule 4  Inspector-General of Intelligence and Security Act 1986",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-3-sec-2009"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:freedom-of-information-removal-of-conclusive-certificates-and-other-measures-act-2009-sch-3-sec-2009-ss-11-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "af14c849b074607d355a32a2014bb255caaca4762ae5c1bd9580722aeddce2a5",
      "skos:note": "Consider a record of proceedings in the Division as previously constituted when reconstituting."
    },
    {
